qBittorrent Neo
===============

qBittorrent Neo is a fork of qBittorrent 5.2.4 (https://www.qbittorrent.org,
https://github.com/qbittorrent/qBittorrent, tag release-5.2.4) whose Qt
Widgets graphical interface is replaced by a native SwiftUI macOS interface.

* qbittorrent/ contains the unmodified qBittorrent sources, imported with
  their full history (git subtree; the `upstream` branch points at
  release-5.2.4). qBittorrent is Copyright (C) 2006-2026 The qBittorrent
  project and contributors and is licensed under the GNU General Public
  License version 2 or (at your option) any later version, with the OpenSSL
  linking exception described in qbittorrent/COPYING. Its license files
  (qbittorrent/COPYING, COPYING.GPLv2, COPYING.GPLv3) are kept unchanged.
  Original author: Christophe Dumez. Current maintainer: Sledgehammer999.
  Contributors: Vladimir Golovnev, Stefanos Antaris, Mohammad Dib, Mirco
  Chinelli, Ishan Arora, Arnaud Demaizière, Grigis Gaëtan, Christian Kandeler,
  Silvan Scherrer, Nick Tiskov and the contributors listed at
  https://github.com/qbittorrent/qBittorrent/graphs/contributors. The
  translations are imported from qBittorrent's, made by its volunteer
  translators (https://explore.transifex.com/sledgehammer999/qbittorrent/).

* core/ hosts qBittorrent's application core (src/base, src/webui) inside
  the app. core/src/neoapplication.cpp and core/src/addmanager.cpp contain
  code adapted from qBittorrent's src/app/application.cpp and
  src/base/addtorrentmanager.cpp (Copyright (C) 2015-2024 Vladimir Golovnev,
  Copyright (C) 2006 Christophe Dumez), GPL-2.0-or-later. The other files
